## Quick Reference

### File Organization
- Section JS: `sections/[section-slug]/js/[section-slug].js`
- Shared classes: `js/lib/ClassName.js`
- Shared functions: `js/functions/featureName.js`
- Utilities: `js/utils/utilityName.js`

### Naming Conventions
- Classes: `PascalCase`
- Variables/Functions: `camelCase`
- Constants: `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE`
- DOM Elements: `$prefixed`
- Files (sections): `kebab-case.js`
- Files (classes/functions): `camelCase.js`

### Always
- ✅ Use dynamic imports for code splitting
- ✅ Validate constructor parameters
- ✅ Handle import errors with .catch()
- ✅ Document with JSDoc comments
- ✅ Use feature detection
- ✅ Prefix DOM elements with $

### Never
- ❌ Inline JavaScript in PHP/HTML
- ❌ Use jQuery in custom code
- ❌ Load JavaScript unconditionally
- ❌ Use frameworks (React, Vue, Angular)
- ❌ Ignore error handling
